{"id":"b02eb3a45a036bc3","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-set12-inductive-subset.md","title":"ZFC Set12 Inductive Subset","display":"df-zfc-set12-inductive-subset — ZFC Set12 Inductive Subset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set12-inductive-subset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set12-inductive-subset"],"display":"df-zfc-set12-inductive-subset — ZFC Set12 Inductive Subset","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-inductive.md]]","[[58-df-zfc-set-successor-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set12-inductive-subset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set12-inductive-subset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set12-inductive-subset — ZFC Set12 Inductive Subset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f6d414affafe82d\" href=\"?note=2f6d414affafe82d\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-inductive.md\">../batch03/58-df-inductive.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"41f4fbd9958e25c1\" href=\"?note=41f4fbd9958e25c1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-successor-set\">58-df-zfc-set-successor-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,A,x,s\\in V\">\\(I,A,x,s\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ind}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ind}\\)</span>（归纳集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2f6d414affafe82d\" href=\"?note=2f6d414affafe82d\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-inductive.md\">../batch03/58-df-inductive.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSetSuccessorSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSetSuccessorSet}_S\\)</span>（冯诺依曼后继谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"41f4fbd9958e25c1\" href=\"?note=41f4fbd9958e25c1\" title=\"58-df-zfc-set-successor-set\">58-df-zfc-set-successor-set</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12InductiveSubset}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12InductiveSubset}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本原子定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}subset}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12InductiveSubset}_S(I,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ind}(A)\\land I\\subseteq A\\land\\varnothing\\in I\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\exists s\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSetSuccessorSet}_S(s,x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}subset}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12InductiveSubset}_S(I,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ind}(A)\\land I\\subseteq A\\land\\varnothing\\in I\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\exists s\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSetSuccessorSet}_S(s,x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该谓词表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是归纳集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的一个归纳子集；底元固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>，后继固定为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\mapsto x\\cup\\{x\\}\">\\(x\\mapsto x\\cup\\{x\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>原来的任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_A\">\\(0_A\\)</span> 与任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_A\">\\(S_A\\)</span> 描述的是一般归纳代数，而不是 ZFC 的归纳集。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-inductive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2f6d414affafe82d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-inductive.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-successor-set","status":"resolved","id":"41f4fbd9958e25c1","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-set-successor-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-inductive.md","status":"resolved","id":"2f6d414affafe82d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ind}$（归纳集谓词，见 [[../batch03/58-df-inductive.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-set-successor-set","status":"resolved","id":"41f4fbd9958e25c1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcSetSuccessorSet}_S$（冯诺依曼后继谓词，见 [[58-df-zfc-set-successor-set]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I,A,x,s\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ind}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSetSuccessorSet}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12InductiveSubset}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}inductive\\text{-}subset}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12InductiveSubset}_S(I,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Ind}(A)\\land I\\subseteq A\\land\\varnothing\\in I\\land\\forall x\\in I\\;\\exists s\\in I\\;\\mathrm{ZfcSetSuccessorSet}_S(s,x)","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"x\\mapsto x\\cup\\{x\\}","display":false},{"tex":"0_A","display":false},{"tex":"S_A","display":false}],"bytes":1238,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3430","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-set12-inductive-subset.md|58-df-zfc-set12-inductive-subset]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","2f6d414affafe82d","41f4fbd9958e25c1"]}